# Braided bed rug (issue 166): rag-rug rows of brick, cream, denim and mustard inside one another, with seams, a rounded rectangle. Seen from above like the floor: flat, ink outline, palette only, no print or text. 7x3 tiles. Lies on the floor under the furniture and the player.
size: 112x48
